Package: libwlroots-0.20
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Wayland compositor backend library (unofficial build)
 libwlroots is a library for writing Wayland compositors.
 This is an unofficial build of wlroots 0.20 for Debian trixie arm64
 (Raspberry Pi OS), which only packages wlroots 0.18.

